    Saturn: { ch: 59, verses: "61-68", favourable: { conditions: "Saturn is in a trikona in Pisces, in Libra, in its own sign, in an auspicious Navamsha, or associated with a benefic in a kendra, trikona, or the 3rd from the lord of the dasa. Saturn in Libra, Pisces, Sagittarius, Capricorn, or Aquarius in the 1st is stated to give Raja Yoga.", effects: "Possible results include success in ventures, happiness from the employer, comforts during journeys, increased happiness and property in one's own village, and audience with those in authority." }, adverse: { conditions: "Saturn is deprived of strength and dignity, is in the 8th or 12th, or is associated with a malefic in the 6th, 8th, or 12th from the lord of the dasa.", effects: "Possible results include distress to oneself and kinsmen, agony, increased cattle wealth alongside loss of wealth, government fines, resignation from an existing post, foreign journeys, danger from thieves while traveling, physical distress, obstacles in ventures, lethargy, defamation, and loss of life of parents." }, maraka: "If Saturn is the 2nd or 7th lord, fear of a threat to life is stated.", phases: "", remedy: "Havan with sesame seeds and charity of a black cow or a female buffalo." },
